B.a0J=new A.af("Welcome","These terms govern your use of JobPilot, a tool that helps you find job postings and prepare tailored application materials. By creating an account or using the service, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use JobPilot.")
B.a0Q=new A.af("What the service does","JobPilot scrapes public job listings, scores how well they match your search profiles, and uses AI to draft cover letters, tailored CV text, and answers to common application questions. You review everything and submit applications yourself on the employer\u2019s website. JobPilot does not submit applications on your behalf and does not guarantee interviews, offers, or employment.")
B.a0S=new A.af("AI-generated content","Drafts are produced by automated language models and may contain errors, outdated information, or claims that do not apply to you. You are responsible for reviewing and correcting every draft before you use it. You must not submit content you know to be false or misleading to an employer.")
B.a0V=new A.af("Your responsibilities","You agree to provide accurate information, use the service only for your own job search, respect the terms of the job boards and employer sites you apply through, and not misuse the service (for example, by attempting to overload it, scrape it, or use it to send spam). You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure.")
B.a0M=new A.af("Availability and changes","The service is provided \u201cas is\u201d and \u201cas available\u201d. We may change, suspend, or discontinue features at any time, and automated workflows (scraping, AI drafting) depend on third-party APIs that may be rate-limited or unavailable. We do not warrant uninterrupted or error-free operation.")
B.a0H=new A.af("Limitation of liability","To the maximum extent permitted by law, JobPilot is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the service, including missed opportunities or decisions made based on AI-generated content.")
B.a0X=new A.af("Account deletion","You can delete your account at any time from Settings \u2192 Danger zone. Deletion permanently removes your profile, search profiles, CVs, and drafts. See the Privacy Policy for details on data handling.")
B.a0T=new A.af("Updates to these terms","We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms. Material changes will be reflected in the \u201clast updated\u201d date above.")
B.UO=s([B.a0J,B.a0Q,B.a0S,B.a0V,B.a0M,B.a0H,B.a0X,B.a0T],t.Wy)
